        "eng": "The story follows the daily adventures of a middle-aged man who passes away and returns to life as a cat who is adopted by the president of the company for whom he used to work.",
        "jpn": "物語は平凡な老人がある日突然可愛い猫に転生し、勤め先の会社の社長に拾われるところから始まります。"
    },
